# User Interaction Protocol

## 1. Introduction

The User Interaction Protocol describes how students, support staff, and administrators interact with the Virtual Customer Support System.

The system should provide a simple, clear, and user-friendly experience.

## 2. Main Users

The system has three main types of users:

### Student

Students can:

* Login
* Search the knowledge base
* Create tickets
* Track tickets
* Receive support
* Submit feedback

### Support Staff

Support staff can:

* View tickets
* Accept assigned tickets
* Communicate with students
* Provide solutions
* Update ticket status
* Resolve tickets

### Administrator

Administrators can:

* Manage users
* Manage support staff
* Manage tickets
* Manage knowledge-base articles
* View feedback
* Monitor the system

